<h1>Toggle Wireframe</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span class="Mode" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Toggle Wireframe</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>viewport context menu &gt; Render Mode &gt; Toggle Wireframe</b></span> </i><span lang="EN-GB">or by pressing</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>W</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">These command toggles the current shading mode (<a href="Rendering_Flat_and_Flat_Shaded_Mode.htm">Flat</a> or <a href="Rendering_Smooth_and_Smooth_Shaded_Mode.htm">Smooth</a>) with shading + wireframe mode (Flat + Wireframe or Smooth + Wireframe) and vice versa. It affect visual representation of scan data and meshes only.</span></p>
